OL,3,GNEWSATaekwondo 'important' for kids,
OL,4,Asays world champ
OL,5,
OL,6,FA world champion says taekwondo is
OL,7,Fimportant in teaching children to have
OL,8,F"discipline, control and the ability to
OL,9,Fdefend yourself".
OL,11,FAlan Collins, from Northamptonshire,
OL,12,Fwon a gold medal in sparring and a
OL,13,Fbronze in patterns at the Taekwondo
OL,14,FWorld Championship in Poland last
OL,15,Fmonth.
OL,17,FHe joined 11 other teammates from the
OL,18,FWellingborough-based club BoroTKD which
OL,19,Fbrought home 19 medals between them.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
